@crew v-quinlan-yuki
// Writer 2, batch 8: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello. Quinlan. Charts. Yes, two pencils. One's for emergencies.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. I've drawn your mess hall. You're in it. Small.   #funny
?

== chat
- Two pencils. One draws, one argues.   #funny
- The bar here's quiet enough to draw in. That's high praise.

== near
? habit:window-seat
- Window seat. The view never needs correcting.
? habit:bar-regular
- One drink. One sketch. That's the deal.
?

== bye
- {bye}. Don't move. I've nearly got you.   #funny

== smalltalk
- Second pencil. Emergency.   #funny
- Draws the charts. Doesn't read them.   #funny
